{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"lint","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lint"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"@kirana-style/eslint-plugin","source":"@kirana-style/eslint-plugin"}},{"type":"text","value":" reports what the compiler knows, where the code is\nwritten, in the linter you already run."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Other styling lint plugins re-implement CSS validation in JavaScript, and drift from\nthe compiler they check. Kirana's rules read the compiler itself (the diagnostics,\nthe atoms each style compiles to, every token, how imports resolve), so lint and\nbuild never disagree, and the plugin is mostly about the mistakes no compiler can\nsee: an override that silently loses, a forwarded "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":" in the wrong place, a class\nthat never reaches the DOM."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"pick-your-linter","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pick your linter"}]},{"type":"component","name":"linters","attributes":{},"children":[]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Under Oxlint and ESLint the rules are the same objects, and so are their results:\nthe same reports at the same places, and the same fixed text. A test runs every\nrule through both linters on each change. Biome cannot run JavaScript rules, so\nit gets the five that need no compiler, rewritten as GritQL plugins."}]},{"type":"component","name":"figure-lint","attributes":{},"children":[]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"oxlint","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Oxlint"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Through Oxlint's JavaScript plugins, at Oxlint's speed:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"// .oxlintrc.json\n{\n  \"jsPlugins\": [\n    { \"name\": \"kirana\", \"specifier\": \"@kirana-style/eslint-plugin\" },\n  ],\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"kirana/diagnostics\": \"error\",\n    \"kirana/sx-last\": \"error\",\n    \"kirana/no-conflicting-props\": \"error\",\n    \"kirana/override-keeps-conditions\": \"error\",\n    \"kirana/no-classname-on-sx\": \"error\",\n    \"kirana/no-dark-variant\": \"warn\",\n    \"kirana/no-unused\": \"warn\",\n  },\n}","lang":"jsonc","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-comment\">// .oxlintrc.json</span>\n{\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;jsPlugins&quot;</span>: [\n    { <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;name&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;kirana&quot;</span>, <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;specifier&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@kirana-style/eslint-plugin&quot;</span> },\n  ],\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;rules&quot;</span>: {\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;kirana/diagnostics&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;error&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;kirana/sx-last&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;error&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;kirana/no-conflicting-props&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;error&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;kirana/override-keeps-conditions&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;error&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;kirana/no-classname-on-sx&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;error&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;kirana/no-dark-variant&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;warn&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;kirana/no-unused&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;warn&quot;</span>,\n  },\n}"}},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"eslint","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ESLint"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Flat config:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"// eslint.config.js\nimport kirana from \"@kirana-style/eslint-plugin\"\n\nexport default [kirana.configs.recommended]","lang":"js","html":"// eslint.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">config</span>.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">js</span>\nimport kirana from &quot;@kirana-style/eslint-plugin&quot;\n\nexport default [kirana.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">configs</span>.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">recommended</span>]"}},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"biome","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Biome"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"@kirana-style/biome-plugin","source":"@kirana-style/biome-plugin"}},{"type":"text","value":" carries the rules that need no compiler, as\n"},{"type":"link","href":"https://biomejs.dev/linter/plugins/","children":[{"type":"text","value":"GritQL plugins"}]},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx-last","source":"sx-last"}}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"no-conflicting-props","source":"no-conflicting-props"}}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children